   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Directed movement and destination with the accusative",
     "texto": [
      "The accusative answers the goal of the action: **Ich stelle die Flaschen in den Kühlschrank** (I'm putting the bottles inside the fridge); **Lege das Besteck in die Schublade** (Put the cutlery inside the drawer); **Wir hängen die Uhr an die Wand** (We hang the clock on the wall).",
      "Key contrast: while the dative answers \"where is it?\" (position), the accusative answers \"where does it end up?\" (goal)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
